5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Let's be thorough. I'll start by looking into independent checks on holdings' reported figures and appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'm interested in the human element. I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want to see the reality of our growth. I'll look at account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I need to understand our liquidity. I'll examine reserve accounts and follow-on calls, and the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll focus on the friction of deployment. I'll take security review time before first deployment and delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
