20,2,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
21,2,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
22,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
23,2,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
24,2,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
25,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems our reporting is too reliant on self-reporting for software, and hardware audits are costing us significant time and money.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,We have a surplus of logistics advisers but a severe shortage of capacity for software board seats.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Our most stable returns come from back-office financial tools, while physical operations have been our biggest failure.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"We are burning through reserves much faster than planned, and our credit line is useless for subscription-based security.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Security reviews for medical or financial data are causing massive delays, while hardware supply chains are a gamble.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Misaki, if the credit line doesn't support subscriptions, we need to be very careful about the business model we pick.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, does the delivery record suggest that software is always safer than hardware?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, the audit fees you mentioned sound like a burden we should avoid if we want a peaceful quarter-end.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Misaki,,Exactly. We need something that doesn't drain our reserves early or rely on unbacked credit.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Shion,,"Not necessarily, Jonathan. Software with high security requirements can be just as slow to deploy as a broken supply chain.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We need a balance between verifiable data and low administrative overhead.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,It sounds like we are stretched thin on software oversight. Maybe a different sector is better?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Shizue,,But the data shows our financial tooling exits were the most successful. We should weigh that.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Misaki,,Only if the follow-on calls for such companies aren't as aggressive as our current trends suggest.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Shion,,I'm wary of anything that triggers a three-quarter security review. That's a death sentence for seed momentum.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's see the candidates and apply these filters: low audit cost, verifiable figures, and fast deployment.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,And manageable staffing needs.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Shizue,,And strong customer retention.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Misaki,,And a sustainable capital call schedule.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Shion,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
