50,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"We have Clinic Scheduler, Ledger Bridge, Fabric Loop, and Harvest Sensor. Ledger Bridge fits the financial profile Shizue mentioned.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Fabric Loop and Harvest Sensor would need field crews or supervisors, which my research says are hard to place.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Clinic Scheduler and Harvest Sensor have great retention, but Fabric Loop's model looks like the write-off I saw.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Ledger Bridge is software, but if it's subscription-based, it won't help our credit line issues.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Clinic Scheduler will be trapped in security reviews for months. Ledger Bridge is faster, but still sensitive.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Harvest Sensor provides verifiable field data, but the appraisal costs for hardware are a nightmare for me.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, is Ledger Bridge's security review shorter than the medical one?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Shizue,,Ledger Bridge aligns with our most profitable exits. It seems the safest bet for returns.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm worried about the reserves. If Ledger Bridge is purely software, does it require less follow-on capital?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Shion,,Likely. And it avoids the hardware shortages that plagued our other holdings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll vote for Ledger Bridge. It avoids the hardware audit fees and provides a cleaner close.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It doesn't require the specialized field staff that we can't currently recruit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I'm also for Ledger Bridge. The historical success of financial back-office tools is too strong to ignore.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"If it's the most capital-efficient and avoids physical assets, I can support it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Shion,,It's the fastest path to deployment without the medical-grade security lag.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
